# A replica does not keep the replication offset it has applied: its INFO master_repl_offset stays at the offset its full sync started from, so the tests' wait_for_ofs_sync never sees it in sync (compat/delta.md item 44); these tests also read INFO mem_total_replication_buffers, which PeaDB does not report (item 22).
Shutting down master waits for replica to catch up (sigterm)
Shutting down master waits for replica to catch up (shutdown)
Shutting down master waits for replica timeout
